<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin to appear on TV at 1400 GMT Thursday-Tass.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin to appear on TV at 1400 GMT Thursday-Tass.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin will appear on television at 1400 GMT on Thursday to make an appeal to the nation, Itar-Tass news agency said, quoting spokesman Sergei Yastrzhembsky.</p>
</text>
